    · rintro ρ (hρ | hρ)
      · exact hv1 ρ hρ.le
      · exact hv5 ρ hρ.le
    · intro ρ h1 h2 h3 h4
      rcases lt_or_gt_of_ne h1 with hρ1 | hρ1
      · -- `ρ < κ/2`: `g = 0` near `ρ`
